<title>UK: Oleo Int'l sets $62.50 mln bond with warrants.</title>
<headline>Oleo Int'l sets $62.50 mln bond with warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Yamaichi International (Europe) Ltd and Fuji International Finance.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OLEO INTERNATIONAL LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  THE FUJI BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $62.50 MLN    COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    20.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE   WARRANTS	ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   GROSS UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE ARE TWO WARRANTS PER BOND TO SUBSCRIBE FOR</p>
<p>		SHARES OF COMMON STOCK OF NOF CORP. EXERCISE PERIOD</p>
<p>		03.FEB.97-13.DEC.00. FOREX FIXED AT 112 YEN/$1.</p>
<p>		MINIMUM EXERCISE 50 WARRANTS. FIXING 04.DEC.96.</p>
<p>		INDICATED PREMIUM 2.50 PCT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
